# Bodycam: Alien Evidence

A full-campaign mod for **Destroy All Humans! (2020)**: the entire alien-invasion story retold as leaked first-person bodycam footage.

You play the invasion from behind a camera: one human operative with a pistol, a shotgun, and a rifle — no psychokinesis, no jetpack, no hologram, no bodysnatch, no alien weaponry. Everything the alien used to do with powers, you now do with tactics and gunfire.

## Features

- First-person bodycam view across the full campaign
- Three realistic weapons replace the entire alien arsenal
- All alien powers removed; every mission re-tuned around gunplay
- Found-footage treatment: camcorder filter, timestamp / REC HUD, battery meter, on-mic audio
- All six invasion locations re-balanced for a human on foot

## Status

**Design phase.** This repository holds the design package: the design document, the JSON data sheets that serve as the single source of truth for the mod's systems, and the build guide. Playable builds will be added as they are produced — building and testing requires a PC copy of Destroy All Humans! (2020).

